  "title": "Have you eaten?",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**Present perfect**: done, and it matters now. Stem + **-েছি / -েছিস / -েছো / -েছে / -েছেন**: **খেয়েছি** 'I have eaten', **করেছে** 'he has done'.\n\n**-নি** means 'didn't' or 'haven't (yet)'. Add it to the present form: **খাই → খাইনি**, **যাই → যাইনি**, **আসে → আসেনি**, **করো → করোনি**.\n\n**এখনো** + -নি = 'not yet': **সে এখনো আসেনি**.\n\nQuestions use **কি**: **আপনি কি খেয়েছেন?**\n\nKeep -নি for the plain past and the perfect. The 'used to' and 'was doing' pasts (next unit) take **না**.",
